 "lead_paragraphs": [
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "CAPITAL RETURNS:",
    "zh": "现金分配："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "FY12-25 OCF $46.3B less capex $14.2B left **$32.0B FCF**. Buybacks **$8.3B (26%)**; no dividends; acquisitions **$3.3B**. Most FCF stayed on the balance sheet as cash and long-term investments.",
    "zh": "FY12-25 OCF $463 亿减资本开支 $142 亿，得 **FCF $320 亿**。回购 **$83 亿（26%）**；未派息；收购 **$33 亿**。大部分 FCF 留在资产负债表上，成为现金和长期投资。"
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "NET SHARES:",
    "zh": "净股数变化："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "Diluted ADS-equivalents FY21 352M to FY25 343M, **down 2.6%**; buybacks roughly offset stock pay (SBC $0.5B in FY25). 344.5M diluted now.",
    "zh": "稀释 ADS 等值股数由 FY21 的 352M 降至 FY25 的 343M，**减少 2.6%**；回购大致抵消股权激励（FY25 SBC $5 亿）。目前稀释股数 3.445 亿。"
   }
  }
 ],
 "commentary": [
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Search growth is over.",
    "zh": "搜索增长已经结束。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Revenue rose from $2.2B (FY11) to $20.2B (FY23), then fell to $19.3B (FY25); Q3 2026 was the sixth straight quarterly decline as online marketing dropped 22%.",
    "zh": "营收由 FY11 的 $22 亿增至 FY23 的 $202 亿，之后降至 FY25 的 $193 亿；2026年Q3 在线营销下降 22%，营收连续第六个季度下滑。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "AI is growing, but not yet enough.",
    "zh": "AI 在增长，但还不够。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "The AI-powered business grew 48% to $6.0B in FY25 and was 43% of revenue in Q3 2026; AI Cloud Infra rose 94% and GPU cloud 191%. It still cannot offset the search decline: legacy revenue fell by $2.3B in FY25 while AI added $1.9B.",
    "zh": "AI 业务 FY25 增长 48% 至 $60 亿，2026年Q3 占营收 43%；AI 云基础设施增长 94%，GPU 云增长 191%。但仍不足以抵消搜索下滑：FY25 传统业务收入减少 $23 亿，AI 业务只增加 $19 亿。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Margins and cash have collapsed.",
    "zh": "利润率和现金流大幅下滑。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "EBIT margin halved from 16.2% (FY23) to 8.0% (FY25); operating cash flow turned negative and FCF was -$2.3B as capex rose to 21% of TTM revenue. My model needs that ratio back near 12% by 2030; if AI capex stays high, the DCF falls sharply.",
    "zh": "EBIT 利润率由 FY23 的 16.2% 减半至 FY25 的 8.0%；经营现金流转负，资本开支升至 TTM 营收的 21%，FCF 为 -$23 亿。我的模型要求该比例在 2030 年回到 12% 左右；若 AI 资本开支持续偏高，DCF 会大幅下降。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "The balance sheet is the floor.",
    "zh": "资产负债表是底线。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Net cash of RMB71.7B plus long-term investments means the ~$25B market value is below gross cash and investments (~$41B). The market is pricing years of cash burn and a China discount.",
    "zh": "717 亿元人民币的净现金加上长期投资，使约 $250 亿的市值低于现金和投资总额（约 $410 亿）。市场在为多年的现金消耗和中国折价定价。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Little has been returned.",
    "zh": "回报股东很少。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Baidu has never paid a dividend; buybacks took 26% of FY12-25 FCF and only offset stock pay. Cash returns, not AI growth alone, would close the gap to book value.",
    "zh": "百度从未派息；FY12-25 回购只占 FCF 的 26%，仅抵消了股权激励。能缩小与账面价值差距的是现金回报，而不只是 AI 增长。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "My DCF says the market is too pessimistic.",
    "zh": "我的 DCF 认为市场过于悲观。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Base $147.81 per ADS (WACC 8.2%, g 2%, beta 1.0) needs $25.8B revenue by 2030 (5.9% a year), an 11.5% EBIT margin and capex back to 12%; TV is 86% of EV. At $73.94 that is +100%; even bear $101.74 is +38%.",
    "zh": "基准价值每 ADS $147.81（WACC 8.2%，g 2%，beta 1.0）要求 2030 年营收 $258 亿（年增 5.9%）、EBIT 利润率 11.5%，资本开支回到 12%；终值占 EV 86%。按 $73.94 计 +100%；悲观情景 $101.74 也有 +38%。"
   }
  }
 ],
